lg:NL-BW3-art15d-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "abc22902adc4a29460a1069516bf237e4d7467ed9d5d3a7ff32b0485de44f206" ;
    lgo:text """1 Anyone providing a service of the information society makes the following data easily, directly and permanently accessible to those using that service, in particular to obtain or make information accessible:
a. his identity and address of establishment;
b. data enabling rapid contact and direct and effective communication with him, including his electronic mail address;
c. in so far as he is entered in a trade register or a comparable public register: the register in which he is entered and his registration number, or a comparable means of identification in that register;
d. in so far as an activity is subject to a licensing scheme: the data on the competent supervisory authority;
e. in so far as he practises a regulated profession:
– the professional association or organisation with which he is registered,
– the professional title and the Member State of the European Union or other State party to the Agreement on the European Economic Area in which it was awarded,
– a reference to the professional rules applicable in the Netherlands and the manner of access to them;
f. in so far as he carries on an activity subject to VAT: the VAT identification number within the meaning of Article 2a(1)(g) of the Turnover Tax Act 1968."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-BW3-art15d-1-q1 .

lg:NL-BW3-art15d-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "75995e071b5a4793d19d7a28fa5d352dc31928d3a6c34b83f5a26ff916a389fb" ;
    lgo:text "2 The service provider indicates prices in a service of the information society clearly and unambiguously, expressly stating whether, and if possible which, tax and delivery costs are included."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-BW3-art15d-2-q1 .

lg:NL-HRW-art27-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "5828ee17942746b49368f2d30e3282d7bc6c22582ee177e2d78e64dbf04172fc" ;
    lgo:text """1 The following undertakings and legal persons entered in the trade register must ensure that the number under which they are entered in the trade register is stated on all letters, orders, invoices, offers and other announcements issued by that undertaking or legal person, with the exception of advertisements:
a. the undertakings and legal persons referred to in Articles 5 and 6(1)(a);
b. the legal persons referred to in Article 6(1)(b), unless documents are issued by a legal person to which no undertaking belongs."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-HRW-art27-1-q1 .

lg:NL-HRW-art27-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a48841e96d011581c91c6512c6d8636f419308c37b2e14d74ca264fb7756951c" ;
    lgo:text "2 The number referred to in the first paragraph is the number referred to in Article 9(a) or Article 13(a)."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-HRW-art27-2-q1 .

lg:NL-HRW-art27-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "7539f168bc7d0db504c32fa4efafe5265d09ea95fb5e9bb303ff04b397d208a8" ;
    lgo:text """3 An exemption from the provisions of the first paragraph may be granted by ministerial regulation. An exemption may not be granted:
a. to European economic interest groupings;
b. as regards letters and orders, to public limited companies, private limited companies and European public limited companies."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-HRW-art27-3-q1 .

lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "ac6f8afc20254fb47398518e5f1dbde66e06248c22c47b777ed893cfaa87881c" ;
    lgo:text """Without prejudice to the General Data Protection Regulation, the storing of or access to information in the terminal equipment of a user via an electronic communications network is only permitted on condition that the user concerned:
a. has been provided with clear and complete information in accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation, in any event about the purposes for which this information is used, and
b. has given consent thereto."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-1-q1 .

lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "eaa1cf27d623e252f60ded399ff7ed7368324e76b1c5bce437bb0b433dcc28ff" ;
    lgo:text "The requirements referred to in the first paragraph, points a and b, also apply where, other than by means of an electronic communications network, it is brought about that information is stored or access is granted to information stored on the terminal equipment via an electronic communications network."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-2-q1 .

lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "10ed31370de101fa7cc1e4439bee6dbf447dce58a76bf1cad792260b030085cd" ;
    lgo:text """The provisions of the first paragraph do not apply where the storage or access concerns:
a. having as its sole purpose the transmission of communication over an electronic communications network, or
b. being strictly necessary in order to provide a service of the information society requested by the subscriber or user or – provided this has no or negligible consequences for the personal privacy of the subscriber or user concerned – in order to obtain information about the quality or effectiveness of a service of the information society provided."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-3-q1 .

lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-4-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "1adf1914837359c350c2b71f6fc94cd4446d67d45232c2f108883e55f3d55db1" ;
    lgo:text "An act as referred to in the first paragraph, which aims to collect, combine or analyse data about the use of various services of the information society by the user or subscriber so that the user or subscriber concerned may be treated differently, is presumed to be processing of personal data."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-4-q1 .

lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-5-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "5f3277fc7fe081184e22b693b20c85f03a022e123587acd1abd8a2b4b0b58e1c" ;
    lgo:text "Access of the user to a service of the information society provided by or on behalf of a legal person established under public law shall not be made dependent on the giving of consent as referred to in the first paragraph."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-5-q1 .

lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-6-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "d10bc82cd128a0b01fbe176254f56c8a5d49322c9b61b28e36f1587ca5504fd2" ;
    lgo:text "Rules may be laid down by or pursuant to a general administrative measure, in accordance with Our Minister of Justice and Security, regarding the requirements referred to in the first paragraph, points a and b, and the exceptions referred to in the third paragraph."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-15"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-TW-art11-7a-6-q1 .
